     "explanation": "The Genius of the AND rejects both compromise and either/or choice-making. Visionary companies build organizational mechanisms that let them pursue two seemingly contradictory goals -- such as purpose and profit -- at full strength at the same time, rather than settling for a diluted version of each.",
