      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='80' text-anchor='middle' font-size='30' fill='#ffffff'>Mapping Core vs. Practice</text><rect x='200' y='150' width='700' height='120' rx='18' fill='#ec4899'/><text x='550' y='218' text-anchor='middle' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff'>1. List what feels non-negotiable</text><line x1='550' y1='270' x2='550' y2='330' stroke='#888' stroke-width='6'/><polygon points='535,330 565,330 550,360' fill='#888'/><rect x='200' y='365' width='700' height='120' rx='18' fill='#0ea5e9'/><text x='550' y='433' text-anchor='middle' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff'>2. Apply the 100-year, any-cost test</text><line x1='550' y1='485' x2='550' y2='545' stroke='#888' stroke-width='6'/><polygon points='535,545 565,545 550,575' fill='#888'/><rect x='200' y='580' width='700' height='120' rx='18' fill='#8b5cf6'/><text x='550' y='648' text-anchor='middle' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff'>3. Everything else is practice, open to change</text><line x1='550' y1='700' x2='550' y2='760' stroke='#888' stroke-width='6'/><polygon points='535,760 565,760 550,790' fill='#888'/><rect x='200' y='795' width='700' height='120' rx='18' fill='#ffd700'/><text x='550' y='863' text-anchor='middle' font-size='18' fill='#1a1a2e'>Short protected core + wide-open practice list</text></svg>",
